        rdfs:comment                   "Seal bag of green silk velvet, 1600s, French; silver embroidery, coat of arms"@en , "Seal bag of green silk velvet, lined with leather. It is circular in shape with a wide circular base reinforced with pasteboard and shallow sides, pleated and pulled together with drawstrings (now missing). It is couched with silver filé over parchment; there is a coat of arms on the base of 3 fleur-de-lys on a blue shield."@en ;
